# AppError & API Responses

## AppError (pkg/utils/errors/code.go + registry.go)

```go
errors.From("DATA_NOT_FOUND")
errors.From("VALIDATION_FAILED").WithDetail("email required")
errors.From("USER").WithMessage("custom message")
errors.New("CUSTOM", 400, "message")

errors.Is(err, "DATA_NOT_FOUND")   // string code, uses errors.As internally
errors.Respond(c, err)             // Fiber handler
```

**Registry codes** (add to `registry.go` before use):

`BAD_REQUEST`, `UNAUTHORIZED`, `FORBIDDEN`, `VALIDATION_FAILED`, `INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR`, `DATA_NOT_FOUND`, `USER`, `ROLE`, `ACCOUNT`, `ACCOUNT_MEMBER`, `VERIFICATION_CODE`

**Error JSON:** `{ "code", "message", "status", "details" }` — no wrapper.

## Success

```go
api.Base{Data: result}
api.Base{Message: "success"}
```

## Pagination

Service returns `*transformer.Pagination`; handler wraps with `api.Base{Data: result}`.

```json
{ "data": [], "meta": { "pagination": { "limit", "page", "sort", "total_rows", "total_pages" } } }
```
